        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, some countries may have restrictions on the services we provide and how we provide them and/or may limit the rates that can be charged for the services we provide or impose other service terms or restrictions.",
        "start_character": 83183,
        "end_character": 83406
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
