        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, we offer Wireless subscribers competitive consumer plans with no annual service contracts and monthly service plans including high-speed data and unlimited talk and text.",
        "start_character": 39533,
        "end_character": 39714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For certain services in the U.S., we are required to contribute fees, computed as a percentage of our revenue from telecommunications services to various funds, including the Universal Service Fund (“USF”) to support mechanisms that subsidize the provision of services to low-income consumers, high-cost areas, schools, libraries and rural health care providers.",
        "start_character": 76864,
        "end_character": 77226
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For further information see “Item 1A – Risk Factors – Competition and Economic Risks – We face intense and increasing competition from providers of video, broadband and/or wireless services, which may require us to further increase subscriber acquisition and retention spending or accept lower subscriber activations and higher subscriber churn.”",
        "start_character": 37752,
        "end_character": 38098
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, foreign countries in which we currently, or may in the future, operate may not authorize us access to all of the spectrum that we need to provide service in a particular country.",
        "start_character": 83407,
        "end_character": 83598
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, as a provider of telecommunications and interconnected voice over internet protocol services, we are required to abide by a number of rules related to telephony service, including, but not limited to, rules dealing with the protection of customer information and the processing of emergency calls.",
        "start_character": 77667,
        "end_character": 77977
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we cannot provide certain equipment or services to certain countries subject to U.S.",
        "start_character": 86149,
        "end_character": 86246
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In general, if a court determines that one or more of our products or services infringe intellectual property rights held by others, we may be required to cease developing or marketing those products or services, to obtain licenses from the holders of the intellectual property rights at a material cost or to redesign those products or services in such a way as to avoid infringing any patent claims.",
        "start_character": 89495,
        "end_character": 89896
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021817-0ea8d7785a214f60",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021817",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In light of the AT&T Transactions, we transitioned to a Hybrid MNO under which we continue to operate our 5G Network core and utilize AT&T’s network services and secondarily as an MVNO utilizing network services under the MNSA and the NSA.",
        "start_character": 39105,
        "end_character": 39344
      },
